{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a286b3e4e76dc2587870a5c633e849d270234a7609e8852c72f827c5fdcd3f4b", "ja": "（恵美のライブが終わった！\n満員の劇場に、ファンの歓声が響いている……）", "zh": "（惠美的演唱会结束了！\n座无虚席的剧场回荡着粉丝的欢呼声……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "6ebf1c6e4bf311ed0b719ad2c2e37977a4b7229738080889007779ebd8b59d25", "ja": "うぅ……。", "zh": "呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "53b9000395831a2cce18e24e005741701bef4ba326cd27f493b4168e49623d79", "ja": "恵美、大丈夫か？", "zh": "惠美，你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "cc46125dfbe7ca8a141ed8a60b7fa6a7e32f9aa15c02c9a034aca2a4b7301f14", "ja": "{$P$}！\nアタシ、泣いてないよ！　泣いてないからね！？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我没哭喔！真的没哭喔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0036431e8f9e5c8559f6a7d8e05c16e1663d1467d69e21c5b86143c7b0a375f0", "ja": "ああ、わかってるよ。\nお疲れさま、恵美。よく頑張ったな！", "zh": "嗯，我知道。\n辛苦了，惠美。你很努力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "82d28b0a5966a16b8304fdf701eec2a935aa65a0a643102c44bc0f6e61fcd825", "ja": "も……も～っ！　{$P$}、\nわざと言ってるでしょ～！？　グスッ。", "zh": "讨……讨厌～！{$P$}，\n你是故意这样讲的吧～！？（啜泣）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "160f3aedca4551e151308abce0a04b1a1919a39a29e23c9031997d72c4550689", "ja": "ご、ごめんごめん！　そういうつもりじゃ\nなかったんだが……ほら、深呼吸して。", "zh": "抱、抱歉抱歉！\n我没有这个意思……来，深呼吸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "5562fa76a4f6c84313d05d7e1b55778d1a921e80518164978f6e6795b7d4b3d6", "ja": "すぅ……はぁ……。\n……ん。もう、大丈夫……。", "zh": "（吸气……吐气……）\n……嗯，我没事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1008_p", "source_sha256": "81e9b8a252b0515957ae1066e8eef6b8bc776a05a982a422467cab260eed49d0", "ja": "そうか、よかった。\n恵美は案外、泣き虫だよな。", "zh": "是吗？那就好。\n没想到惠美是个爱哭鬼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "f50344bd1951a56b709518079feb0cafcb5db6fc490235156e9831e8c6f29240", "ja": "そ、そんなんじゃないけど……\nでもさ、仕方がないじゃん！　聞いてよ、ホラ！", "zh": "人、人家才不是……\n这样哪有办法不哭嘛！你自己听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1010_null", "source_sha256": "46916ff0e56e721daaae35b1569628199b7c21845657497927aabb8ad85d3a7b", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "e37b63a7430515a32348b2e41ae44e5a1bfa597fe9d1035e04a5a90320850080", "ja": "アタシのステージで、ファンのみんながこんなに\nよろこんでくれて、アンコールまでしてくれてさ。", "zh": "粉丝们看了我的表演后这么高兴，\n还一直大喊安可。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "bc0905942bd19498490ddc7f1314932a3e772071ef1a9f1250ca0ff996b0dde6", "ja": "そんなの、うれしくないワケないじゃん……\nうぅ……。", "zh": "我怎么可能不感到开心呢……\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5b04fdcafd7e52da1062e32169e62f2126629b2f4e2724fe11bf91cfede6c45b", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\n恵美が毎日、一生懸命レッスンした結果だな。", "zh": "嗯，确实呢。\n这是惠美每天努力练习的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "3681eea5323385a7d07eff3d2798c95e36a0e1d63eeca510cc5ccdf85363e1f6", "ja": "レッスンは、自分でもけっこう頑張ったと思うけど……\nでもそれだけじゃないよ、{$P$}。", "zh": "虽然我也觉得自己练得很认真……\n但不是只有这样，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "204e220d489e23cd5617082b9d631ccfb689d75375c93e2d816850e16c0516a0", "ja": "アタシが頑張れたのは、ファンのみんなや仲間たち……\n今まで出会ったみんなが、いたからじゃないかな。", "zh": "我之所以能坚持下去，不都是因为\n有粉丝和伙伴们……至今为止遇过的大家在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "f1d7c17e1537f97f92e126093df4d0ef9ba49f655bd1bf22bb2725051b40c677", "ja": "アタシがもしも、ひとりだったら、\nこんなに頑張ってなかったかもって思うんだ。", "zh": "如果我一路都是孤独一人，\n或许就不会像现在一样这么努力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f81f2bdacf6cca7e9649ee18f917fec1f2779b4ec292bbc1875a72cb0293ad29", "ja": "そうか。恵美のその気持ちは、\nファンのみんなにも伝わったんじゃないかな？", "zh": "这样啊，我想惠美的想法，\n应该也传达到粉丝们的心中了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1018_null", "source_sha256": "46916ff0e56e721daaae35b1569628199b7c21845657497927aabb8ad85d3a7b", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "cada0fa3b41f41a8e2ab1bf7d4c8dd12578e2b9983c96b924322022ffcf64170", "ja": "うん……へへっ。{$P$}、\nアンコール、行ってきてもいいかな？", "zh": "嗯……嘿嘿。\n{$P$}，我可以回去再唱几首吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3e710f9167f29d960700deea69913e4d4361a07e6525701f547d9dea58aee77c", "ja": "もちろんだ。みんな、恵美を待ってるからな！", "zh": "当然可以，大家都在等惠美呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "a49ee7326f530419cc85bcbd6afeac9b0587396ba1838a146587da10244f27ca", "ja": "ありがとっ♪　それじゃ、アタシ、行ってくる！\nあっ……えっと、{$P$}！", "zh": "谢谢♪那我上场啰！\n啊……那个，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0084_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "ca7fda3f00c523c5453daa6c34a355f16962ffc2fa878ad2e2f279f6060a92fb", "ja": "みんなにはトーゼン、{$P$}だって\n入ってるんだからね！　……ありがとーっ！", "zh": "我所说的大家，当然也包含{$P$}喔！\n……谢谢你──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
